&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.cybereason.co.jp/assets/img/Sep2021_Aug2022_Japan_Certification_Logo_RGB.png&quot; alt=&quot;Great Place to Work&quot; width=&quot;57&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
